"use client";
/**
 * Calendar & Planning (source L26686–L27193, v67): a second, planning-oriented workspace over the Gestion Calendrier
 * domain. It owns only presentation preferences, calendar visibility sets and the waiting list with its matching on
 * freed slots; appointments, availability, rooms and statuses go through the Calendar's API (same roles), visit stages
 * and tasks through Cabinet, identity through Patients. Shell, calendar workspace (day / week / work week / month /
 * agenda) with the right panel and upcoming strip, dialogs, appointment drawer, smart booking panel, quick create,
 * internal events, drag and drop, secondary views (schedule, appointments, patients, practitioners, rooms, waiting list,
 * recurring, availability, types, integrations, notifications, reports), keyboard, menus, live updates.
 *
 * Deliberate structure (ADR-04 exception, as for HR, Billing, Patients, Calendar and Cabinet): typed imperative island
 * filling the `.hr.plapp` container. The code below is the source's own text with types added; the OS integration
 * (L27194–L27212) is replaced by src/apps/planning/PlanningApp.tsx. Module-level integrations (bus consumers) are
 * installed by plInstallIntegrations(), called only when the healthcare suite runs natively.
 *
 * Simulated as in the source (S class): every appointment and waiting-list entry is synthetic; external calendars and
 * video links are shown as not connected.
 */
